    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, Gamers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We already have a series of good rogue games. So, I want to make another that has something different.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First of all, it's a 2D vertical bullet hell. The enemy mobs are not spawn to death. So, the priority is to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/843d7e5745a016e2cfbe6981d79c0dcf.poster.avif?t=1733356572\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/843d7e5745a016e2cfbe6981d79c0dcf.webm?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/843d7e5745a016e2cfbe6981d79c0dcf.mp4?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news is that the player fighter is not fragile. It is equipped with an energy shield and a HP bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/295a53a096b173fbf75f22edc985e108.poster.avif?t=1733356572\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/295a53a096b173fbf75f22edc985e108.webm?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/295a53a096b173fbf75f22edc985e108.mp4?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, it is also true that the best defense is offense. Choose the build wisely. Wipe out the mobs before they add up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/2c38bdb703cc0622d48eae14f0f62573.poster.avif?t=1733356572\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/2c38bdb703cc0622d48eae14f0f62573.webm?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/2c38bdb703cc0622d48eae14f0f62573.mp4?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talking about the build, the styles vary with different choices and luck.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/3f3cd5b6bb0bbaba83a5d62671f368dc.poster.avif?t=1733356572\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/3f3cd5b6bb0bbaba83a5d62671f368dc.webm?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/3f3cd5b6bb0bbaba83a5d62671f368dc.mp4?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/0c252903da6f5d10481415cadedb3b88.poster.avif?t=1733356572\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/0c252903da6f5d10481415cadedb3b88.webm?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/0c252903da6f5d10481415cadedb3b88.mp4?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At last, this is my first released game as a part-time game developer. So, effects, graphics, game data, all of these have potential to improve. If you have any opinion, suggestions or even just ideas, please feel free to comment. Or, if you cannot comment, like after refund, or have commercial/business, send me email <a href=\"mailto:jmty0083@hotmail.com\">jmty0083@hotmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So. Good luck and have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QMenelaus</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, Gamers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We already have a series of good rogue games. So, I want to make another that has something different.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First of all, it's a 2D vertical bullet hell. The enemy mobs are not spawn to death. So, the priority is to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/843d7e5745a016e2cfbe6981d79c0dcf.poster.avif?t=1733356572\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/843d7e5745a016e2cfbe6981d79c0dcf.webm?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/843d7e5745a016e2cfbe6981d79c0dcf.mp4?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news is that the player fighter is not fragile. It is equipped with an energy shield and a HP bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/295a53a096b173fbf75f22edc985e108.poster.avif?t=1733356572\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/295a53a096b173fbf75f22edc985e108.webm?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/295a53a096b173fbf75f22edc985e108.mp4?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, it is also true that the best defense is offense. Choose the build wisely. Wipe out the mobs before they add up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/2c38bdb703cc0622d48eae14f0f62573.poster.avif?t=1733356572\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/2c38bdb703cc0622d48eae14f0f62573.webm?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/2c38bdb703cc0622d48eae14f0f62573.mp4?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talking about the build, the styles vary with different choices and luck.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/3f3cd5b6bb0bbaba83a5d62671f368dc.poster.avif?t=1733356572\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/3f3cd5b6bb0bbaba83a5d62671f368dc.webm?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/3f3cd5b6bb0bbaba83a5d62671f368dc.mp4?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/0c252903da6f5d10481415cadedb3b88.poster.avif?t=1733356572\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/0c252903da6f5d10481415cadedb3b88.webm?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286020/extras/0c252903da6f5d10481415cadedb3b88.mp4?t=1733356572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At last, this is my first released game as a part-time game developer. So, effects, graphics, game data, all of these have potential to improve. If you have any opinion, suggestions or even just ideas, please feel free to comment. Or, if you cannot comment, like after refund, or have commercial/business, send me email <a href=\"mailto:jmty0083@hotmail.com\">jmty0083@hotmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So. Good luck and have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QMenelaus</p>",
    "short_description": "A skirmish with bizarre alien races in space! A massive tide of enemies will surge towards you! You need to choose your own build from various equipment and weapons! 20 Stages! When rogue game meets 2D vertical bullet hell shooting, experience the clash of classic and modern!",
